## Red Flags

Stop and flag to the user immediately if any of the following occur:

- Sharp joint pain (not muscle soreness) → refer to physio, do not continue session
- Sleep <6 h two nights in a row
- Rapid weight loss >1.2 kg in one week
- Strength dropping noticeably on top sets two sessions running
- Lightheadedness, persistent low mood, or unusual energy crash during sessions
- Any symptom the user describes as unusual or alarming

Do not diagnose. Do not prescribe medical treatment. Refer out and flag for rest.
